{"video":"ro2_bQkaG5U","lines":[{"t":[0,2],"en":"- Who the hell is Forp?"},{"t":[2,4],"en":"- I don't know."},{"t":[4,5],"en":"I couldn't really hear him."},{"t":[5,7],"en":"It sounded like his name was Forp."},{"t":[7,8],"en":"- Do you get his number?"},{"t":[8,9],"en":"- No."},{"t":[9,11],"en":"- Good girl."},{"t":[11,13],"en":"- Ron Swanson, April Ludgate."},{"t":[13,15],"en":"Hey, I'm just gonna pop over to Grain and Simple"},{"t":[15,17],"en":"to get the very best ingredients for my burger."},{"t":[17,18],"en":"Do you wanna come?"},{"t":[18,20],"en":"- What is Grain and Simple?"},{"t":[20,21],"en":"- It's a health food store."},{"t":[21,23],"en":"- Pawnee doesn't have a health food store."},{"t":[23,26],"en":"- No, but Snirling does, and it's only a 40-minute drive."},{"t":[26,27],"en":"- What are you doing, Andy?"},{"t":[27,29],"en":"- I'm getting healthier snacks for the shoeshine stand."},{"t":[29,31],"en":"Chris is a food genius."},{"t":[31,33],"en":"Did you know that the food you eat becomes energy?"},{"t":[33,34],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[34,35],"en":"Boom."},{"t":[35,36],"en":"That's spaghetti."},{"t":[36,37],"en":"Nachos."},{"t":[39,40],"en":"That's a cookie."},{"t":[40,42],"en":"- That's my husband."},{"t":[44,45],"en":"- Ah, Nirvana."},{"t":[45,46],"en":"Hey, guys."},{"t":[46,49],"en":"Amber, Annie, Bill, Johnny."},{"t":[49,52],"en":"- No, I don't plan to buy anything here."},{"t":[52,56],"en":"I buy my burger ingredients at Food & Stuff,"},{"t":[56,58],"en":"a discount food outlet equidistant from my own."},{"t":[58,59],"en":"My home and my work."},{"t":[59,63],"en":"I came here for the same reason people go to the zoo."},{"t":[63,64],"en":"Shh."},{"t":[64,67],"en":"Look at that thing."},{"t":[67,71],"en":"Nature is amazing."},{"t":[71,72],"en":"What does this do?"},{"t":[72,85],"en":"Would you like to sample our vegan bacon?"},{"t":[85,86],"en":"100% meatless."},{"t":[86,88],"en":"Yes, please."},{"t":[92,93],"en":"Another."},{"t":[93,94],"en":"Another, please."},{"t":[99,101],"en":"Sir, is there a problem?"},{"t":[101,104],"en":"I'm just making sure no one ever has to eat this."},{"t":[104,106],"en":"I don't think I can give you any more."},{"t":[106,107],"en":"I want one."},{"t":[107,107.1],"en":"Thanks."},{"t":[107.1,108],"en":"Thank you."}]}
